WEBVTT

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.390
It is just like a jewel.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.080
Its splendor dims before your brilliance.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.350
If you allow such banal 
words to cross your lips again,

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:27.830
I will tear out this tongue of yours.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.610
Oui, mon impératrice.

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.980
Can we land now, Admiral?

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:43.970
Yes, General Hannibal.

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.240
Let us go, Charles,

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:50.840
to the azure Star of the East,

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:54.870
so verdant and green,
 and plentiful with water.

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:56.830
I can hardly wait.

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:05.570
<i>All Giant War Armor units,</i>

00:01:05.570 --> 00:01:07.300
<i>activate auto-pilot mode.</i>

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.700
All descent ships have 
reached the stratosphere.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:12.070
Ley lines are stable.

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:15.300
<i>Adjusting output of deceleration balancers.</i>

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:17.980
Will the Cerberus twins
 turn the Star of the East into Hell?

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:58.830
<i>The Renaissance that transformed 
the Star of the West...</i>

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.090
<i>Technological innovations gave rise</i>

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:05.110
<i>to weapons known as
 Giant War Armor in massive quantities,</i>

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:07.650
<i>and King Arthur became a conquerer.</i>

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:14.320
<i>The inventor, Leonardo da Vinci, 
goes to the Star of the East</i>

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:17.630
<i>with Jeanne d'Arc,
 the girl who sees visions,</i>

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.040
<i>to seek the truth behind
 the ley lines and the quanta,</i>

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:21.500
<i>and find the Savior-King.</i>

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:25.860
<i>As the ley lines' East-West balance crumbles,</i>

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:29.290
<i>the war continues to escalate.</i>

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:39.050
Granite floors are cold.

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:41.380
But they're kind of hard.

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:44.100
It might be nice to lie on.

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.390
Oh, maybe.

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:48.660
Stop. We're not cats.

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:10.750
Ah, Ichihime.

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:13.900
Please do not look so sad.

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:17.370
What can I do to make you smile?

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:22.190
Oh!

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:23.730
I have just the thing.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:24.690
You cannot!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:29.830
None may enter Ichihime-sama's bedchambers.

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:33.340
C'mon, just a peek.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:36.220
Why, you are just a child.

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:37.340
How impertinent.

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:40.550
We are Ichihime-sama's ladies-in-waiting.

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:43.830
We cannot let you pass, no matter what.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:47.220
These girls are amusing, Nel.

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:50.260
Yes, they are, Bianchi.

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:02.870
They're gone?

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:04.970
Huh?

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:07.160
Wh-What is this?

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.100
Wait, your face.

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:11.020
Huh? What?

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:12.490
What?!

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:13.930
Hey, what?

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:18.770
What the...

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:25.330
What is this?

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:29.030
Western tea and sweets.

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:32.760
Sweets... This black thing?

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:36.500
Torta tenerina.

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:38.560
It's chocolate.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:40.700
Cho-co-late...

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:45.010
What is that white snow-like powder?

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:47.780
It's powdered sugar.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:51.280
Please try it.

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:58.290
Ah, what a mysterious, sweet fragrance.

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:07.120
Oh, my!

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:10.900
It is slightly bitter, yet sweet.

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:14.040
I have never tasted anything like it.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.370
It is delicious.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:17.900
I'm glad to hear that.

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:20.040
I am proud of how it turned out.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:20.940
What?

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:25.560
Then... you made this by 
your own hand, Caesar-dono?

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:27.420
Is that so strange?

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.680
I am a little surprised.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:35.650
After all, the warriors of 
the East do not make sweets.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:38.190
The same goes for the West.

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:39.740
Oh, my.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.780
Finally, a smile.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:47.680
You are much more beautiful when you smile.

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:52.060
You should not speak of beauty so casually.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:53.640
Why not?

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:57.860
What is wrong with describing
 things of beauty as being beautiful?

00:06:58.240 --> 00:06:59.970
Th-That is...

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:04.340
Snow?

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:11.200
Why, at this time of year?

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:17.770
That's...

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:23.050
I think things are going to get interesting.

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:35.520
How beautiful...

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:39.070
Snow! It's snowing!

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:42.020
So in Owari, snow falls even in the summer.

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:49.550
Oh? How curious.

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:52.440
These sandals are warm.

00:07:53.230 --> 00:07:54.540
Hey!

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:56.730
What are you doing?!

00:07:56.730 --> 00:08:00.140
I warmed them for Nobu-sama in my bosom!

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:01.620
Your bosom?

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:04.430
That's creepy, Hideyoshi.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.650
You are calling my kindness 
toward my master "creepy"?!

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:11.360
You're giving me the the chills.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:17.420
Aren't the two of you friendly...

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:18.650
Nobu-sama.

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:22.770
Mitsu. This snow, this sky...

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:28.240
I can smell war.

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:30.060
War?

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:36.510
Wh-Wh-Wh-What is this?!

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:43.200
That card is the Empress,

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:45.150
a female emperor.

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:46.580
Oh?

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:50.660
It seems this card can 
recognize my royal blood.

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:58.590
This unseasonal snow...

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:01.760
I'd like to show you something.

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:07.000
What have you done?

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:09.700
I "compressed" the air.

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:12.950
When it is released all at once...

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:20.520
Frost?

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:21.460
Brr!

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:23.300
What is this?

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:27.060
Adiabatic expansion!

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:32.180
I believe this is the trick 
behind this midsummer snow.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.850
Mon impératrice, I believe it is time.

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:45.470
Yes.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:09.600
What is that?

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:16.500
Giant War Armor from the West!

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.250
The Carolus Magnus,

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:22.250
belonging to General Charlemagne, 
wielder of the Regalia of wind.

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:24.590
And the Carthago Nova,

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:27.520
belonging to General Hannibal, 
wielder of the Regalia of water.

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:31.600
I see.

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:35.810
So those clouds were due to
 Hannibal and Charlemagne after all.

00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:41.370
It's because you've been dithering, Caesar.

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:44.540
Maybe they are going to one up you.

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:48.780
What do the two of you know?

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:53.080
Who knows?
 Maybe something you don't need to know?

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:56.280
Maybe something you don't 
want other people to know?

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:03.660
So that is an Eastern castle...

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.290
I am looking forward to

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:11.160
the reception from the Eastern barbarians.

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:30.650
So, Hannibal and Charlemagne.

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:37.190
Hah! It's not like the length 
of your name decides your worth!

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:41.220
The Fool, Orléans, and Goku, advance!

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:43.570
Goku, launching!

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:45.070
Orléans, launch!

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.700
The Fool, going out!

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:50.840
Nobu-sama!

00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:53.690
Please allow me to
 land the first blow!

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:55.380
Very well. You have my permission!

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:56.490
It is an honor!

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:09.860
Then the border on the Echigo 
side is also closed off by snow?

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:11.280
Indeed.

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:15.460
The blizzard is such that even 
skilled scouts cannot cross it.

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:18.230
The eastern shore of
 Biwa Lake is frozen over.

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:21.370
So the Oda are completely isolated...

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:25.600
This is hardly an act of nature.

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:32.380
It appears your star is making
 its move upon this star in earnest.

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:35.920
Caesar-dono.

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:42.420
I am Oda Nobunaga's best retainer,

00:12:43.210 --> 00:12:44.390
Toyotomi Hideyoshi!

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:47.160
I will strike the first blow!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:50.170
You are a country boy, 
acting like a wild monkey!

00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:01.510
Charles, let's do this.

00:13:02.060 --> 00:13:04.150
Oui, mon impératrice.

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:07.420
Corda due!

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:15.690
Lame du glace!

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:19.550
What?!

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:20.680
The ice!

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:22.600
I can't move!

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:23.470
Monkey!

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:25.590
Goku was immobilized!

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:28.440
Yes, this is

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:30.710
adiabatic expansion!

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:37.980
Hideyoshi-sama's Giant War Armor...

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:40.420
Charles...

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:40.980
Oui.

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:45.080
Lame du glace!

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:56.000
The people!

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:00.310
Oda Nobunaga!

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:03.460
If you value their lives,

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:07.010
hand over all the
 Regalia in your possession!

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:11.590
They were after the
 Regalia from the very beginning.

00:14:11.590 --> 00:14:14.460
Taking hostages! How dishonorable!

00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:18.520
This is simply tactics.

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:22.430
Honor is an irrelevant 
concept in my strategy.

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:24.930
He's certainly upfront about it.

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.760
On the Star of the West,

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:31.170
the ends justify the means,
 so long as you achieve victory.

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:34.440
Nobunaga!

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:40.340
Hostages mean nothing to me.

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:41.580
What?!

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:42.840
Oh?

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:45.350
That's a shame.

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:47.420
Ice will be met with fire!

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:48.850
I will burn you down!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.670
Ranmaru!

00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:05.130
All of you, sheathe your weapons!

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:12.410
I will give you my Regalia's key.

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:15.650
Let everyone go. I beg of you!

00:15:16.610 --> 00:15:17.910
Oh?

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:19.260
Ranmaru!

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:20.280
This is war!

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:22.510
So what?

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:25.390
You must not become the Destroyer-King!

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:27.790
Oda Nobunaga is the Savior-King!

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:30.060
What did she just say?

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:33.080
Oui, she said "Savior-King."

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:45.440
Ranmaru!

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:54.890
So you are the girl from 
Donremy who sees visions.

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:56.950
Very well.

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:00.300
I will release the hostages.

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:06.080
Charlemagne, release their lives!

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:09.100
J'ai le plaisir,

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:12.220
mon impératrice.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:36.550
What have you done?!

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.970
You promised!

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.400
Silence, demon child!

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:46.240
Our heavenly King Arthur is the 
sole Savior-King of this world!

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.750
You deserve a million
 deaths for your disrespect!

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:52.810
You... are the demons!

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:55.710
Nobunaga!

00:16:58.930 --> 00:16:59.680
What?!

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.020
Don't move!

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:20.110
Nonsense!

00:17:20.110 --> 00:17:22.340
Raising your blade
 against mon impératrice...

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:23.840
you will pay for that in blood!

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:28.780
Nobu... naga...!

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:36.050
Bah, if only Azuchi was here in time...

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:41.790
It appears this dome of clouds is 
amplifying their Regalias' powers.

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:45.890
Shred these clouds, now!

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:48.300
Our cannons are not
 strong enough to reach them!

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:54.610
If only I could wield a Regalia, myself!

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:56.690
Charles!

00:17:56.690 --> 00:17:58.310
Kill Nobunaga!

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.210
Oui!

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:02.310
No!

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:08.220
Veni, vidi, vici!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:21.230
I, Gaius Julius Caesar, am here!

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:22.570
Caesar!

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:25.330
You will turn against a 
Brother of the Round Table?!

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:28.940
I need no reason to save
 the life of my brother-in-law.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:33.340
What husband will not
 listen to his new wife's pleas?

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:36.850
My homeland is in dire straits.

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:40.340
If you will not go, Caesar-dono,

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.600
I will go to Owari, myself!

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:44.350
I cannot.

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:45.850
Why?!

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:49.860
Because it would mean opposing King Arthur.

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:55.360
Then choose, right here and now!
 Me, or your master!

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:02.410
I, Caesar, will gladly turn my blade

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:05.370
against my former 
comrade-in-arms, for love's sake.

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:08.830
Caesar!

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:12.210
Have you gone mad, Caesar?!

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.130
Deploy all platoons!

00:19:14.490 --> 00:19:16.180
Destroy the Oda castle!

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:44.120
I am Uesugi Kenshin.

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:48.620
I orchestrate Visra, avatar of Bishamonten.

00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:50.980
I go forth with righteousness!

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:55.990
So that is Uesugi's famed 
Giant War Armor, Visra!

00:19:56.940 --> 00:20:01.330
He should also be invited to the banquet.

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:03.270
Nonsense!

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:06.050
Your way of fighting is painful to behold.

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:08.880
In Heaven's name, I will absolve your sins!

00:20:14.670 --> 00:20:16.680
Charlemagne!

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:24.420
Your sullied blade cannot touch me.

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:34.590
I will not let you escape, mon impératrice!

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:38.130
Hannibal!

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:50.280
Charlemagne!

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:55.950
I entrust... my Regalia's keys... to you!

00:20:58.220 --> 00:20:59.550
Charles...

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:06.020
Je t'aime, Hannibal.

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:21.310
Incoming projectile from the Star of the East!
 It's crossed into satellite orbit!

00:21:21.310 --> 00:21:24.140
Beacon confirmed! It's General Hannibal!

00:21:24.140 --> 00:21:25.650
Retrieve her ASAP!

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:28.350
Retreat before the
 interference zone becomes active!

00:21:44.270 --> 00:21:45.550
Ranmaru!

00:23:17.060 --> 00:23:18.320
Charles...

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:22.320
Is that you, Cesare?

00:23:22.320 --> 00:23:25.610
My condolences regarding General Charlemagne.

00:23:25.610 --> 00:23:27.990
I <i>will</i> avenge him.

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:33.190
I will turn the entire Star 
of the East into Hell itself.

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:37.370
Is that the girl who sees visions?

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:39.490
Indeed.

00:23:39.490 --> 00:23:41.780
First, I will flay her alive...

00:23:46.080 --> 00:23:47.510
Cesare...

00:23:48.880 --> 00:23:50.260
Wh-What are you...

00:23:50.480 --> 00:23:53.540
I can't have you doing that.

00:23:57.560 --> 00:24:00.270
Adieu, Hannibal Barca.

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:05.270
May you live happily ever after 
with your beloved Charlemagne.

00:24:12.070 --> 00:24:15.850
All men are haunted by the paths 
they've taken in the past.

00:24:15.850 --> 00:24:18.270
They are devastated by the past, 
yet must overcome it.

00:24:19.280 --> 00:24:21.410
Next time: The Hanged Man.

00:24:22.240 --> 00:24:25.260
The one I must protect is...
